                Customer pricing is controlled by DivyaArpan.
                Your earnings are calculated from the confirmed
                booking amount and settlement rules.
              </Text>
            </View>
          </View>

          <Text style={styles.bottomNote}>
            Earnings shown here are sample data for app
            development. Live earnings will appear after API
            integration.
          </Text>
        </ScrollView>
